// Gods of AI — Series Four. Copy is final; art is generated from real photographs.
// Hand-curated (not auto-generated). `front`/`back` are written by the publish step —
// do not hand-edit those two fields.
//
// The brief: the architects. People who designed the ideas, the models or the
// infrastructure that machine learning actually runs on — weighted, deliberately,
// toward those who gave their work away. A brilliant closed model earns less room
// here than a merely good open one, because this site is about open source.
//
// Nobody appears in more than one series. Every scouting report is factual and
// checkable. No invented quotes: `note` is editorial voice, not attribution.

